          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <span class="metric-label">Variance</span>
            <span class="metric-value">&plusmn;1.2%</span>
            <span class="metric-note">Week-over-week stability across model updates</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="metrics-disclaimer">Benchmarks run nightly against the SWE-bench Verified dataset. Updated <time datetime="2025-01-15">January 15, 2025</time>.</p>
      </div>
