            <h3 class="card-heading">Continuous Validation</h3>
            <p class="card-body">Every commit, every model, every prompt change. Murmur runs your agent through a gauntlet of real-world coding tasks and surfaces regressions before they reach your CI pipeline. No more silent degradations.</p>
          </article>
