            <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="icon-square"></span></div>
            <h3 class="card-heading">Pass@K Sampling</h3>
            <p class="card-body">Single-pass accuracy hides the truth. Murmur computes pass@k with configurable temperature and sampling strategies, giving you a statistically honest picture of agent capability under stochastic conditions.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="icon-frames"></span></div>
