                        <p>We shipped an agent that writes database migrations. Without Murmur, every model upgrade was a coin flip. Now we catch regressions in CI — pass@1 went from 78% to 94% in two weeks because we could finally measure what we were optimizing.</p>
                    </blockquote>
                    <figcaption>
                        <strong class="testimonial-name">Elena Voss</strong>
                        <span class="testimonial-role">Staff Engineer, Infrastructure Reliability — Tessera Labs</span>
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

