                </h1>
                <p class="hero__subhead">
                    Murmur is a thin, deterministic harness that plugs into any coding agent pipeline.
                    It benchmarks every commit, surfaces regressions, and tells you exactly how much
                    you can trust each generation — before it reaches production.
                </p>
                <div class="hero__actions">
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn--primary">Star on GitHub</a>
